        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(1) Internal Sale or Transfer – In the event the Company changes ownership of all or a part (i.e., a part employing permanent, full-time bargaining unit employees) of its existing corporate operations by the sale or transfer of such operations to an existing or a newly created subsidiary or corporate affiliate, the applicable Collective Bargaining Agreements shall be binding on any such subsidiary or affiliate.",
            "block_bbox": [
